# 🌍 Real-World Enterprise Network

```
Internet

↓

Firewall

↓

DMZ (Public Servers)

↓

Internal Firewall

↓

Core Router

↓

Switches

↓

Employee PCs

↓

Servers

↓

Database

↓

Backup Server
```

### DMZ (Demilitarized Zone)

Public-facing services like:

* Web Server
* Email Server

are placed in a DMZ so they are separated from the internal network.

If a web server is compromised, attackers still face additional barriers before reaching sensitive internal systems.

